   "payload": {
    "paragraph": "<h2>We provide a <strong>free consultation</strong> and offer a <strong>product presentation of equipment and software</strong> in our showroom.</h2><p>Our specialists will:</p><ul><li>Explain all product features in detail</li><li>Demonstrate how the equipment and software work</li><li>Answer all your questions</li><li>Help you choose the best solution for your business</li></ul><p>We select equipment or software tailored to your company’s specific needs and goals.</p><h3>For more information, please call <a href=\"tel:+373 69 116121\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(115, 115, 115);\">+373 69 116121</a></h3><p><br></p>"
   },
   "createdAt": "2026-02-13T15:19:42.515Z",
   "updatedAt": "2026-03-18T09:58:09.266Z",
   "__v": 0
  },
